# OmaleBrandProfile — Enterprise-Grade Upgrade Plan

> **Full codebase audit completed 2026-05-13.** This plan covers every finding, prioritised by severity.

## Current State Summary

The application is a **personal brand portfolio** for Omale Danjuma Ogale, built with **SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5** (runes mode), **Tailwind CSS 4**, **Convex** backend, and **Cloudflare Pages** deployment. It currently has:

- **1 route** (`/`) with 12 portfolio sections rendered as components
- **1 error page** (`+error.svelte`)
- **Convex backend** with 11 tables (many are E-WIN leftovers)
- **Firebase** SDK installed but only used for deleted auth features
- **Service Request Form** — the only interactive feature (submits to Convex)

